silm:instances_papers_09_minimal_category_theory_sections_08_colimit_universal_property_yoneda_hom_leg_4_identifier_leg silm:hasExample "In 'S08ColimitUniversalPropertyYonedaHomLeg4', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, the MicrochipIdentifier9 -> Mittens identifier leg; identifier strengthens the type seed, never replaces the individual" .
